    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d525-a13">

                <pb facs="0822" n="694" sameAs="frus:frus1885/pg694"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 12 in No. 312.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Vickers to Mr. Pueyo</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Consulate of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Matanzas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1885-01-16"><hi rendition="#italic">January</hi> 16,
                        1885</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: It will be sufficient reply to your
                    communication of this date to inform you that the captain has been instructed by
                    me to make no reply whatsoever to any communication which you may address him,
                    except through this consulate, which is his proper representative.</p>
                <pb facs="0823" n="695" xml:id="pg695"/>
                <p>With respect to the fine imposed I have likewise instructed both him and the
                    consignee not to satisfy it pending the decision of the Government of Madrid,
                    before which it will be referred.</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>DAVID VICKERS,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Consul.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
